WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,890
Is it any wonder that this combination happened?

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:04,500
Of course it's a combination

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,860
The spirit world is the largest competitive airport in Shomosing.

4
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,860
Many attractive players fund their clubs

5
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,580
That's why I chose this one

6
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,380
And the people here have all kinds of ways.

7
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:15,020
It won't be like the school's rules when it comes to taking action.

8
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,740
Actually, I saw it on the spirit world forum

9
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,100
Someone is reselling entry spots

10
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,020
I just didn't expect that I would meet him so soon

11
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,220
Think in a good direction

12
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:24,540
This is better than taking a direct shot on the field. You are right.

13
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:26,980
Do you make much money playing games here?

14
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,420
If you win the first game with a bonus of 5,000,

15
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,620
Are you qualified to play in the spirit world?

16
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:32,060
The latter ranges from 50,000 to 200,000

17
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:35,140
If you can only upgrade to LV2 or LV3, someone will suppress you.

18
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,340
You can make tens to millions in one game

19
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:37,940
Become famous and earn money to watch events

20
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:38,900
I heard there is no cap

21
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:42,260
Then repairing the mecha is a lot of expense, right?

22
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:44,060
But the spirit world has its own repair room

23
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,340
Discounts for repairing mechas

24
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,700
If the damage is minor, you can leave it un repaired for the time being.

25
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:50,340
If you win a few more games, you can earn money for modifying mechas.
